+ <li>More detailed family relationship codes (e.g. from the <a href="https://terminology.hl7.org/6.0.2/ValueSet-v3-PersonalRelationshipRoleType.html">Personal Relationship RoleType ValueSet</a>)
+   MAY be sent as additional codings in the same <code>Group.member.involvement</code> CodeableConcept.  These SHOULD also be accompanied by the 'family-member' code in that CodeableConcept to support systems that might not understand more detailed codes.  If
